  "working_tree": "Uncommitted code-intelligence work; this receipt and documentation follow the frozen checks.",
  "shared_implementation": "Retained LanguageAnalysis constructs immutable LanguageReview. Shared frontend orchestration persists the review and obtains sessionless manual authority; one native resource interpreter and authority verifier serve Remote and proven Local above thin journal/root adapters. Native descriptor primitives return identity and metadata; shared provenance determines allowed application-owned changes.",
  "contract": [
    "Protocol-3 AnalysisContext publishes aligned bounded opaque revisions, identities and paths authenticated by the original service. Limits remain explicit: 2 MiB metadata aggregate, 32 KiB per metadata record, 2 MiB identity aggregate and the existing 4 MiB native response limit. Archived omitted vectors retain earlier serialized fingerprints.",
    "Native Linux/macOS observations read mode, link count, ownership, size, mtime and ctime from the same descriptor before and after identity acquisition. Untouched original objects require exact metadata; a script-moved root permits its own ctime change, and script-mutated directory namespaces permit their own size/link/time changes while retaining permissions and ownership checks. Descendants do not inherit a moved root exception.",
    "Shared initial checks reject changed originals and existing parents before Applying or active intent, cancel Prepared through the existing durable CAS and perform no resource primitive. Both native adapters test chmod, mtime changes, restored bytes and mtime, and extra hard links after original service/grant expiry, across accepted Prepared, ambiguous directory transfer and irreversible cleanup. Partial cleanup preserves a changed remaining child.",
    "Original identities distinguish u1 persistent birth identity from u0 device/inode-only identity. New review-bearing resource work rejects u0 originals before initial authority claim; ordinary read analysis remains available. Command-only actions may retain an empty signed observation set, which still rejects any attempted original-object access. Native Windows resource execution remains unavailable.",
    "LanguageAnalysis.language_review captures the selected original package and installation revision, original input/context/full result and exact transaction/editor digest. Construction issues no query, preparation or grant. The backend accepts native version-2 Some reviews without conferring worker authority merely by storing evidence.",
    "After the project lock and durable Begin, shared frontend execution requests fresh sessionless user-action authority for the exact project/package only for initial Prepared Apply. Both adapters transmit the same grant to the native worker. Recovery and accepted committed retry request no new grant or LSP analysis. Current provider/configuration and full command approval are enforced by the existing atomic worker admission.",
    "Fresh installed resource traces compare durable LanguageReview input/context/result to the exact original native review response, verify original-service validation before Begin and verify a fresh manual grant after Begin before one native Execute. Local retains its original proven session and performs no browser cursor or mutation loop.",
    "Installed Local and Remote workflows cover actual primitive interruption, host restart, reload and access loss/regrant, rollback preserving a newer draft, admitted Prepared cancellation without folder access, command-only and combined edit/command approval, lost dispatch non-replay and running/uncertain command outcomes. Declared-input rejection/acceptance uses the same live review-bearing path."
  ],
